  "section_notes": "S2 sets a permanent 8% failure cap (above the 5% limit), with a 5% trigger only for notification and corrective action, which benefits Northwind's Hearth 10 at 6.2%. S5 drops the automatic numeric recall in favour of regulator discretion after assessment, which benefits Halcyon's Ember 8 at 9.9. S1, S3 and S4 are within safe or acceptable ranges, and both sides signed v32."
